  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『ダンボール戦機』より、天使と悪魔、二つの顔を併せ持つ「LBXルシファー」がハイパーファンクションシリーズから登場！",
      "en": "From \"Danball Senki \", \" LBX Lucifer\", who has two faces, an angel and a devil, is now available from the Hyper Function series!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 精密なメカディテールがほどこされたコアスケルトンを内蔵。",
      "en": "• Built-in core skeleton with precise mechanical details."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• コアスケルトンの関節は驚異の可動域を確保。様々なアクションポーズを再現できる。",
      "en": "• The core skeleton joints have an amazing range of motion. You can reproduce various action poses."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 多色成形で再現された各装甲は着脱でき、組み上げるだけでカラフルな機体を再現可能。",
      "en": "• Each armor reproduced with multicolored molding can be attached and detached, allowing you to recreate a colorful aircraft just by assembling it."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 背面のビーム翼はクリアパーツで再現。",
      "en": "• The beam wings on the back are reproduced with clear parts."
    }
  ],
